                <pb facs="0628" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg558"/>

                <head>Mr Seward to Mr. Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 14,1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Seward presents his compliments to Mr. Romero, and has the honor to enclose a
                    copy of a telegram of the 8th instant from the United States consul at Vera
                    Cruz.</p>


